  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.596\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- perf: optimize test execution bottlenecks and parallel isolation (#885) (`6e9da47`)\n- perf: isolate CompilerOnlyCliBuildAcceptanceTests into temporary workspace (#884) (`3f6e245`)\n- perf: compile FrozenSdkConsumer variants in-memory with Roslyn and cache compiler publish (#883) (`e3ce955`)\n- docs: qualify Sfx.Play ownership boundary (`2680122`)\n- docs: qualify Sfx.Asset ownership boundary (`f20679e`)\n- docs: census residual Portable2D ownership (`e1d19ce`)\n- SDK: externalize Camera.VerticalScrollMax through typed port (#874) (`1a05958`)\n- ARCH: qualify Camera.VerticalScrollMax ownership (#872) (`19ae97b`)\n- SDK: externalize Camera.ScreenAabbHitTop through typed camera-AABB port (#870) (`48486b1`)\n- ARCH: requalify Camera.ScreenAabbHitTop through typed port (#868) (`2a97edf`)\n- SDK: add typed ScreenAabbHitTop port (#866) (`e862ddc`)\n- ARCH: qualify Camera.ScreenAabbHitTop extraction (#864) (`f987397`)\n- SDK: externalize Camera.ScreenAabbTiles through typed port (#862) (`adf836c`)\n- ARCH: qualify Camera.ScreenAabbTiles extraction (#860) (`10bd586`)\n- feat: externalize camera hit-top port (#858) (`04ecc0e`)\n- feat: preserve typed plugin word results (#856) (`caa1054`)\n- docs: qualify camera AabbHitTop result prerequisite (#854) (`896fa02`)\n- docs: qualify GB object palette ownership (#852) (`e4de9a6`)\n- feat: externalize raw palette setup (#850) (`d05a889`)\n- docs: qualify raw Portable2D palette operation (#849) (`a4f4168`)\n- feat: externalize portable palette declarations (#846) (`4b8cb66`)\n- docs: qualify portable palette declarations (#845) (`5fd1fdf`)\n- Externalize Portable2D projectile pools (#842) (`c047ba9`)\n- docs: qualify projectile pool transformation (#819) (#841) (`9376146`)\n- Externalize BackgroundAnimation.SetEnabled through a typed port (#839) (`afced5d`)\n- docs: qualify Portable2D frame presentation (#838) (`318852f`)\n- feat: externalize Portable2D tilemap setup (#836) (`c52a103`)\n- ARCH: qualify Portable2D tilemap setup slice (#835) (`6d8aeea`)\n- feat: externalize camera AABB tiles through product port (#833) (`9ed21d5`)\n- feat: externalize world activation policy (#832) (`2b755c8`)\n- SDK: externalize Portable2D Music.Play (#831) (`107cfcf`)\n- ARCH: qualify Portable2D music operations (#829) (`d5422e4`)\n- SDK: externalize Portable2D MusicAsset descriptor and interpretation port (#828) (`0fe320a`)\n- ARCH: qualify MusicAsset extraction slice (#823) (`b2b3dd3`)\n- ARCH: qualify camera/world query extraction boundary (#822) (`08a1cd3`)\n- docs: qualify Portable2D world activation policy (#821) (`aeeaf1e`)\n- SDK: externalize Portable2D WorldAsset descriptor (#820) (`09560f2`)\n- ARCH: qualify declarative WorldAsset independently of activation (#811) (`4bb2550`)\n- SDK: externalize Portable2D Sfx.Stop through typed audio port (#809) (`6aa0a54`)\n- docs: qualify Portable2D Sfx.Stop operation (#807) (`a095fa4`)\n- Externalize Portable2D effect-pool contract (#805) (`dedb43a`)\n- docs: qualify Portable2D effect pool transformation (#804) (`838d980`)\n- Externalize Portable2D Animation.Frame (#802) (`d346876`)\n- Qualify Animation.Frame SDK extraction (#801) (`165b53e`)\n- Externalize Portable2D AnimationClip declarations (#798) (`5548c59`)\n- Reduce PR validation time without weakening coverage (#799) (`834c0a0`)\n- Qualify AnimationClip as the next Portable2D resource slice (#797) (`23bddfb`)\n- SDK: externalize Portable2D SFX lifetime policy (#795) (`262eda6`)\n- docs: qualify Portable2D SFX lifetime policy (#793) (`ddc1480`)\n- Externalize SpriteAsset through Portable2D plugin (#792) (`9912e34`)\n",
